# Data & Storage

## Root path

`/var/lib/maehbot/` on Pi (Docker volume mount).

```
/var/lib/maehbot/
  images/          # detection snapshots (ring buffer)
  videos/          # learning drives
  annotations/     # JSON per session
  exports/yolo/    # YOLO training exports
  db/maehbot.sqlite
```

## Retention

- UI default: show last **100** detections.
- Archive max **1000** images; delete oldest when limit exceeded.
- Hard cap **10 GB** total under `/var/lib/maehbot/`; prune images before videos.

## Formats

- App annotations: **JSON** (frame index, bbox, class_id, session_id).
- Model training export: **YOLO** (images + labels); convert for IMX500 deployment separately.
- SQLite: detection metadata only (paths, bbox, class, confidence, timestamp) — not image blobs.

## Writes

- Core: async/background write after spray event; never block hot path.
